stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Allocated: XLogReaderAllocate
    Allocated --> Positioned: XLogBeginRead recPtr
    Positioned --> ReadingPage: XLogReadRecord
    ReadingPage --> CallPageRead: routine.page_read<br/>requested page
    CallPageRead --> CheckSegment: segment open?
    CheckSegment --> SwitchSegment: no
    SwitchSegment --> SegmentOpen: routine.segment_open<br/>(may invoke RestoreArchivedFile<br/>via WaitForWALToBecomeAvailable)
    CheckSegment --> ReadBytes: yes
    SegmentOpen --> ReadBytes
    ReadBytes --> ValidatePage: ValidXLogPageHeader
    ValidatePage --> ReadingPage: invalid<br/>back to caller -> source switch
    ValidatePage --> HavePage: valid
    HavePage --> ParseRecord: copy bytes; check xl_tot_len
    ParseRecord --> ContinuationNeeded: record overflows page
    ContinuationNeeded --> CallPageRead: read next page<br/>(skip page header)
    ParseRecord --> CRCCheck: full record bytes available
    CRCCheck --> Failed: CRC mismatch
    Failed --> [*]: report_invalid_record<br/>caller logs at emode
    CRCCheck --> Decoded: CRC OK<br/>DecodeXLogRecord populates blocks[]
    Decoded --> Returned: ReadRecPtr/EndRecPtr set
    Returned --> Positioned: caller calls XLogReadRecord again
    Returned --> [*]: XLogReaderFree
